# Dompdf's runtime font-metrics cache - auto-generated the first time a given font is
# used for a PDF export, derived from the .afm/.ufm/.ttf files already tracked above it,
# so it doesn't need to be committed and just regenerates wherever the app runs.
vendor/dompdf/dompdf/lib/fonts/*.json